sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant C as cart-service
    participant R as Redis
    B->>C: POST /api/v1/cart/merge {guestId} (JWT)
    C->>R: HGETALL cart:c:Ada, HGETALL cart:g:guest
    C->>C: add quantities, cap at 99
    C->>R: DEL + HSET cart:c:Ada, EXPIRE · DEL cart:g:guest
    C-->>B: 200 merged cart
